eported in #50531 (v41.1.0) and closed as stale. Still reproducible in 43.4.0 (and 42.7.0).\",\n  \"form\": \"bug\",\n  \"labels_already_applied\": [\n   \"43-x-y\",\n   \"bug :beetle:\",\n   \"has-repro-gist\",\n   \"platform/macOS\"\n  ],\n  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n  \"opened\": \"2026-08-14T19:38:51Z\"\n },\n \"form_fields\": {\n  \"electron_version\": \"43.4.0\",\n  \"os\": \"macOS\",\n  \"last_known_working\": null,\n  \"testcase_gist_url\": \"https://gist.github.com/eostrom/b120b0b6412063855bbf9b2677247368\"\n },\n \"repro\": {\n  \"gist\": true,\n  \"other_repo_link\": false,\n  \"code_blocks\": 0\n },\n \"bot_already\": {\n  \"asked_for_supported_version\": false,\n  \"need_repro_label\": false\n },\n \"issues_linked_by_reporter\": [\n  49048,\n  49074,\n  50531\n ],\n \"component_hints\": [\n  {\n   \"label\": \"component/fullscreen\",\n   \"matched\": [\n    \"fullscreen\",\n    \"full screen\",\n    \"togglefullscreen\"\n   ],\n   \"in_title\": true\n  },\n  {\n   \"label\": \"component/menu\",\n   \"matched\": [\n    \"menu\"\n   ],\n   \"in_title\": true\n  }\n ],\n \"redirect_hints\": {\n  \"upstream\": [\n   \"chromium\"\n  ]\n },\n \"similar_candidates\": [\n  {\n   \"number\": 50531,\n   \"opened\": \"2026-03-27\",\n   \"score\": 68.1,\n   \"title\": \"Duplicate \\\"Toggle Full Screen\\\" menu item on macOS\",\n   \"shared_terms\": [\n    \"toggle\",\n    \"duplicate\",\n    \"item\",\n    \"full\",\n    \"menu\",\n    \"screen\",\n    \"still\",\n    \"macos\"\n   ],\n   \"already_linked_by_reporter\": true,\n   \"excerpt\": \"### Expected Behavior Application should contain just one menu entry for \\\"Toggle Full Screen\\\" <img width=\\\"235\\\" height=\\\"232\\\" alt=\\\"Image\\\" src=\\\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08eb281b-e20d-431e-8c69-cebc43c78e54\\\" /> ### Actual Behavior There is a duplicated menu entry for \\\"Toggle Full Screen\\\" <img width=\\\"239\\\" height=\\\"257\\\" alt=\\\"Image\\\" src=\\\"https://git